<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 25 million European-style range corridor warrants, in five equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom AG, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>PAYDATE	    02.DEC.96		MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p>LISTING	    FFURT, DUSS, STUTT   SPOT REFERENCE  32 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE     LOWER BARRIER  UPPER BARRIER  PRICE    MATURITY</p>
<p>I		   32 DEM	  36 DEM	5.24 DEM 28.FEB.97</p>
<p>II		  31 DEM	  36 DEM	6.78 DEM 28.MAY.97</p>
<p>III		 32 DEM	  38 DEM	5.19 DEM 28.MAY.97</p>
<p>IV		  30 DEM	  38 DEM	7.58 DEM 29.AUG.97</p>
<p>V		   30 DEM	  40 DEM	7.40 DEM 26.NOV.97</p>
<p> NOTES    EACH PAY UP TO 10.0 DEM BASED ON THE NUMBER OF DAYS</p>
<p>	    UNDERLYING STOCK REMAINS WITHIN THE RANGE.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
